From b7cef9d7ca05258972b5b267a07254ce648d7f82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: copiousfreetime <jeremy@copiousfreetime.org>
Date: Wed, 26 Feb 2020 22:01:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] resolve minitest spec deprecation warnings

---
